#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -euo pipefail

script_dir="$(cd "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")" && pwd)"
quest_root="$(cd "$script_dir/.." && pwd)"
repo_root="$(cd "$quest_root/.." && pwd)"
build_gradle="$quest_root/app/build.gradle.kts"

version_name="$(sed -n 's/.*versionName *= *"\([^"]*\)".*/\1/p' "$build_gradle" | head -1)"
version_code="$(sed -n 's/.*versionCode *= *\([0-9][0-9]*\).*/\1/p' "$build_gradle" | head -1)"
application_id="$(sed -n 's/.*applicationId *= *"\([^"]*\)".*/\1/p' "$build_gradle" | head -1)"

cat <<EOF
# OpenPanel VR Codex Context

Repo: $repo_root
Quest project: $quest_root
Package: ${application_id:-com.orgista.openpanel.quest}
Version: ${version_name:-unknown} / ${version_code:-unknown}

## Read First

- quest/AGENTS.md
- quest/README.md
- quest/docs/horizon-implementation-map.md
- quest/scripts/README-environment.md
- quest/audits/pine-forest-generated/README.md, when working on the pine skybox
- audits/2026-08-23-openpanel-gui-review/README.md, when working on panel visual fidelity

## Deterministic Commands

- Context summary: quest/scripts/codex-context
- Machine-readable status: quest/scripts/status-json
- Cheap Quest verify: quest/scripts/verify app:testDebugUnitTest
- Full Quest verify: quest/scripts/verify app:testDebugUnitTest app:lintDebug app:assembleDebug
- Launch/capture headset UI: quest/scripts/capture-ui --launch

## Quest Build Notes

- Use quest/scripts/verify instead of raw ./gradlew on the SMB workspace.
- The helper sets OPENPANEL_GRADLE_BUILD_ROOT to \${TMPDIR:-/tmp}/openpanel-quest-build by default.
- It also passes --project-cache-dir \${TMPDIR:-/tmp}/openpanel-quest-gradle-cache and --no-watch-fs.
- Debug APK default path: \${TMPDIR:-/tmp}/openpanel-quest-build/app/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk

## ADB Notes

- Default Quest serial fallback: 340YC10G8D180B
- Standard screencap can be black in immersive apps.
- Use MetaCam capture: quest/scripts/capture-ui --launch
- Captures are stored under repo audits/quest-capture-<timestamp>/ by default.

## Visual Fidelity Notes

- OpenPanel panel texture clarity is controlled through DpPerMeterDisplayOptions in OpenPanelActivity.kt and constants in PanelLayout.kt.
- Meta SDK resize handles are opt-in through IsdkPanelResize; the old visible lower-right dots were app-drawn Compose chrome.
- For panel dots/noise, compare against quest/audits/meta-ui-ppi/current-comparison/zoom-crops-4x.jpg and the latest MetaCam capture.

## Pine Skybox Notes

- Active pine environment is documented in quest/scripts/README-environment.md.
- The corrected 0.3.39 horizon band is derived from the exact angular crop of the reference-driven 8K fallback dome; do not independently render the forward band unless you also solve overlay alignment.
- The generated pine foreground GLB is disabled in 0.3.39 because a Quest 3S capture showed flat slab/post artifacts; re-author and capture before enabling it again.
- Regenerate with: quest/scripts/generate-pine-forest-environment.py --source-dir /Users/macstudio/Downloads/pine_forest --reference-image /Users/macstudio/Downloads/43600e6a5e2d1b2de05000eb4bf89968e4613bc4.jpeg
EOF
